# 23
#title Fix known dependency vulnerabilities
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/23
#branch fix/dependency-vulnerabilities
#base main
#opened 2026-11-09
#head cf8fbe8f14ab604243e485e82759801a349db695
#describe what Patched versions replace every dependency with a known vulnerability, through version bumps and scoped overrides.
#describe what Only js-yaml is a runtime dependency with findings; the rest is test and packaging tooling.
#describe before pnpm audit reported 65 findings: 2 critical, 30 high, 29 moderate, 4 low.
#describe after pnpm audit and pnpm audit --prod report no known vulnerabilities.
#describe verified Typecheck, lint, the full unit suite, compile and the macOS build all pass; e2e and Windows packaging run only in CI.
~ package.json
~ pnpm-lock.yaml
#order package.json
#order pnpm-lock.yaml
#reason package.json Moves js-yaml, vitest and the packaging tools to patched releases and pins patched transitives so audit is clean
#reason pnpm-lock.yaml Resolves the bumped versions and overrides with pnpm 10.28.0 so installs stay reproducible
#story Dependencies free of known vulnerabilities
#step actor A maintainer
#file package.json
#step action installs and audits the dependencies
#file pnpm-lock.yaml
#step subject the app and its build tooling
#file package.json
#below interaction Run the audit and get a clean result
#below consequence 65 known vulnerabilities reported => none reported, shipped bundle unchanged
#file pnpm-lock.yaml
